{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "a-note-from-anaxa",
  "name": "A Note from Anaxa",
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/A_Note_from_Anaxa",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-12T08:09:31.284Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "To (Trailblazer):"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-dfbb379e0fa5c1c3"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Through your collective power, I have completed this life's greatest research, and the performance could have ended."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But in the mind of that Antikytheran, I saw boundless knowledge beyond this world."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "On the final stage, I witnessed you achieve the miracle of defying destiny."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-49485c74d2888480"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It is these mysteries I still cannot comprehend that unlock the riddles confining our world,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "so that our endless groping in darkness shall not be in vain."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Therefore: Having glimpsed the truth beyond the cave, I must never cease my quest."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2f118e4fe62ac1be"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "No matter what form Amphoreus continues to exist in,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I shall continue to carry \"Reason\" until I reclaim the truth,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "and once again surpass and desecrate that which is more divine and magnificent!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-29b4a3ffc2f03ff9"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You can consider this Philosopher's Stone as my reward to you."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I hope you'll treasure this alchemical miracle containing all the wisdom of this world,"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "but when you encounter fools who won't listen to reason, use its hardness to knock some sense into them."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fd3e88cf38e8a92f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Anaxagoras"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-d0f987dab87e5523"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
